{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The root(s) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d93e176a800f5b33ac221e981a7fdddddd52b86e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {15}{x^2 - 4} - \\frac {2}{x - 2} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"153\" height=\"38\" /> is (are): \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10c4a077f8c70a537a7abf26fd3a86ad5b0bc2b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -5\\text{ and }3\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\pm 2\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\text{ only}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ -3\\text{ and }5\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 3\\text{ only}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"584\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use a common denominator: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/5/3156124cd3202e61c39801d00870fdf15cf9e231.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15 - 2(x+2)}{x^2-4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"144\" height=\"42\" />. After moving the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to the left side, notice that you can factor the numerator:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/8/ca8127a750c9d9a3fca0ee31600cd40c9e563c3e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(x-5)(x+3)}{x^2-4} = 0\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"39\" />\nThe roots of this equation are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/4/d24461ebb7f64a42b6f8220244ec1d1f11ee0be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} \\quad -3, 5}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"109\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi